---
import HubLayout from '../layouts/HubLayout.astro';
---
<HubLayout title="Contact — MyToolboxHub" description="Contact MyToolboxHub to report a tool problem, suggest an improvement, or ask a privacy question.">
  <article class="w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 sm:py-20 space-y-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">Contact MyToolboxHub</h1>
    <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">Report an incorrect result, ask a privacy question, or suggest a tool improvement by email.</p>
    <section class="glass p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Email</h2>
      <a href="mailto:profitplannercraft@gmail.com" class="text-accent underline break-all">profitplannercraft@gmail.com</a>
      <p class="text-text-secondary">This link opens your email application. You will need to send the email there; this page does not submit a message.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="space-y-4 text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-text-primary">Reporting an incorrect result</h2>
      <p>Include the tool’s page address, the options you selected, your browser, and what you expected to happen. A small fictional example that reproduces the problem is more useful than a large production file.</p>
      <p>Do not include passwords, live authentication tokens, customer records, or other confidential inputs. Email is separate from the local processing offered by the tools: anything you send will be delivered to this Gmail inbox.</p>
      <p>You can also inspect the <a class="text-accent underline" href="https://github.com/mytoolboxhub/mytoolboxhub.github.io">website source on GitHub</a>. See the <a class="text-accent underline" href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> for information about tool inputs and visits.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</HubLayout>
